## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.5 Flash (`qwen3.5-flash-02-23` hosted snapshot/tier)
- **Short description:** Alibaba’s hosted Qwen3.5-Flash tier described in local metadata as the production profile of open Qwen3.5-35B-A3B weights with 1M context by default.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud Model Studio / hosted APIs and third-party routers (e.g. OpenRouter snapshot per metadata). Local metadata lists `qwen/qwen3.5-flash-02-23` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Alibaba Model Studio model listing reviewed 2026-11-10; specific release/cutoff for this exact hosted tier not clearly stated in reviewed sources.
- **IDs:** `qwen3.5-flash`, `qwen3.5-flash-02-23` (snapshot/provider-specific).
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens by default for hosted tier per local metadata; 65,536 max output. Not independently verified from reviewed official page text.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video input; text output (local metadata; hosted tier of multimodal Qwen3.5 family).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Varies by provider/region (local metadata cites OpenRouter snapshot $0.065/$0.26 per 1M in/out; Model Studio international $0.10/$0.40, China region tiered pricing).
- **Architecture:** Hosted serving profile related to Qwen3.5-35B-A3B open weights (local metadata notes “hosted serving profile, not new weights”); exact served implementation details not independently verified.

